# DuckDB's browser build, loaded by the wasm REPL on its first DuckDB call: published per version by
# tools/duckdb-wasm-publish.sh, fetched for local runs by `make -f Makefile.wasm duckdb-wasm`, sha256-checked by both.
# `pin <version>` is what a build loads; `<version> <path> <sha256> <url>` is one file.  1.33.1-dev114.0 (the npm
# `next` tag, 2026-11-03) embeds DuckDB v2.0.0 (d54cbbe3df, the tagged release) and is the first build exporting the
# v2 C API; its extensions sit at extensions/v<duckdb>/wasm_eh/, where custom_extension_repository has DuckDB fetch them.
pin 1.33.1-dev114.0
